<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Asia raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amway Asia raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it named Amway Asia Pacific as its Focus One Stock of the Week and upgraded the shares to near-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details not available.</p>
<p>-- NYSE-listed shares closed at 29-3/4 on Tuesday. -- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
